<div class="panel contract" style="margin-top:20px">
  <h2>Webhook contract</h2>
  <p class="muted">Each tick, the game <code>POST</code>s this JSON to a bot's webhook URL:</p>
  <pre>{
  "game_id": 1, "tick": 42,
  "arena": { "width": 20, "height": 20 },
  "self": { "id": 3, "name": "Ada", "x": 5, "y": 7,
            "heading": "N", "hp": 80, "max_hp": 100,
            "gems": 4, "downed": false },
  "vision": {
    "radius": 1,
    "walls": [[5,6]],
    "gems":  [[6,7]],
    "bots":  [{ "x": 4, "y": 7, "hp": 60, "downed": false }]
  }
}</pre>
  <p class="muted">Respond within the timeout with one command:</p>
  <pre>{ "command": "move", "dir": "N" }   // N | E | S | W
{ "command": "scan" }               // stay, bigger vision next tick
{ "command": "repair" }             // stay, heal
{ "command": "idle" }</pre>
  <p class="muted" style="font-size:12px">
    Vision is a square radius around you (1 by default, larger the tick after a
    <code>scan</code>). Crashing into a wall or the arena edge, or ramming another
    bot, costs HP. At 0 HP you're downed and must <code>repair</code> before moving.
    No/late/invalid response counts as <code>idle</code>. Optional shared secret
    arrives in the <code>X-Bot-Secret</code> header.
  </p>
</div>
